  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["x", "3"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "94defb0b-af1d-404f-81c4-0fd4734dfe06"],
 " \[Minus] 556x + 3120 as in Example 2.8.2. It turns out that E(Q)\
\[NotTildeFullEqual]Z/2Z \[CirclePlus] Z/2Z \[CirclePlus] ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["Z", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4e3e8ac5-77b0-4d5d-8bab-6c53f46c7897"],
 " . The generators of the\ntorsion part are ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["T", "1"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1611ec57-08fb-4308-af17-8c311dcf1584"],
 " = (6, 0) and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["T", "2"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c4ebf501-4d34-4103-ab6a-97077f4d3bfd"],
 " = (20, 0), and the generators of the free part are P = (\[Minus]8, 84), \
and Q = (24, 60)."
}], "Text",
